<title>USA: Federal Reserve business loans rose in Aug 21 wk.</title>
<headline>Federal Reserve business loans rose in Aug 21 wk.</headline>
<text>
<p>ONE WEEK ended August 21</p>
<p> U.S. business Loans.......360,536 up.....2,399</p>
<p> Excluding acceptances.....358,964 up.....2,397</p>
<p> Govt, agency securities...269,890 down...4,725</p>
<p> Trading account............19,014 down...2,899</p>
<p> CDs, major time deposits..136,642 up.....1,043</p>
<p> U.S. commercial paper.....735,075 up.....6,754</p>
<p> Financial companies.......539,025 up.....8,159</p>
<p> New York business loans....41,290 up.......337</p>
<p> Excluding acceptances......41,061 up.......336</p>
<p> CDs/major time deposits... 22,319 up.......238</p>
</text>
